  "description": "After winning the lottery, Na-Hyeon achieves her dream of buying a spacious home. But there’s one other thing she’s always longed for: to be at the center of a devoted reverse harem! It starts small when Na-Hyeon offers a spare room to her childhood friend, Jae-On. Then another man takes a room, and another, and soon enough, she’s surrounded by men who want to please her in their own unique ways! Can Na-Hyeon keep her lovers in check, or will she be smothered by the affection she’s always desired?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
